{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1334,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50d8074704b1ffd9c8a38c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就交给飞鹰子来炒热气氛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca3b4b4a061142aaaf10875130470d132881d2a77f670848cd22f661dcd30bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c1e25e934f086915fbd307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会变得更可爱的哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50f63778c79565f0d05bf3b3b381d5cbb147f51cf4428302948b9434fba2d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a7f093a236762c84d1062a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变得更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7091e01faa2eeec671fd51c3fe29883aa6bc33e6184344d82db76bb66527d984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535d0ef640f1c56f576b6d7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是迈往顶尖马娘偶像的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f85de706e6a61a81f812ae4c1f845f6092823fc85c226415b63cc2260b88bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16f2709674ba45d55d79a232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是飞鹰子的……\r\n身为马娘偶像的，我的觉悟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb07a1fd39878a635f6e204d04f5b43e429bb934a3b378e506724017c5863e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb0046f99b5daca7fd9b067",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！大家正等着飞鹰子登场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367c5ecbd0f15c353902ff739aede0d702163b02c193d56cbff7f59a7d7b328f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e535d2c1214d95ab23bfad09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1、2、1、2♪向前进～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5862aa6105ca13f8c410c703285e2e9a6ab0de62594022d61d251a447a23d988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d84daf818089eeaf26a2b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是当领队还是什么，都交给我吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "36b6f3558f6deb439399dfccbbe25a09e2ba7b8bce04d45636e531dc67d499e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd395ed2c1a621a07b0aae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前往粉丝身边——大家一起传递梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "804966e0dd4584919e5eaaa6f965512a539d758191314533aab2c6b00105a2a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47830d6d61039db0dcd5a755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到醒目飞鹰的闪亮巡游♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0404cea890d1120405d391ec1e2b8f11fb9ff0a672f7b2d5b2337d5b9851226d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8069b0d78f737248d2f1d95f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a238b480d3d3b03a89f94c8a262afa5391cdeb5e27e2403a45c68ff1ba0db50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86cb2c8ad9d90aac02e60db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到训练员正在寻觅的英雄\r\n就是我……这个命中注定的插曲\r\n真是令人难以忘怀呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "421e257631f4d4d16e48dba3bf45d63ef698ec70a56a06ddf3449d35b9906890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ec3a3f7b3ac6935a57bc66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:453756af0bbd7a98224f5402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98916ce1496d4729c67c55c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有人愿意注视我，\r\n荒漠英雄就永远不会停下脚步，\r\n持续向前奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a72eeb8e2b6910335c8714987490f26d54ffe7a2b8fb909df25ae24346c95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98eab8915637e5196f83696e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这次看到了你许多不同的一面，\r\n但训练员……\r\n果然还是那个训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8e12fcc59b9af02a9066e295e634f666a7c085b92988dd9c136ace68c366f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96787c0f72e1797eb78b227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说年菜原本是供奉神明用的食物。\r\n了解过每项食材背后的故事后，\r\n品尝起来就会觉得更有深度呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c266123496edce8d32a7b18451431a3d65af01ac32cf0a2e75041fc54fcae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0ba186626e317a1bab9096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "某本书里描写的巧克力实际发售了。\r\n共有一百种口味……所以，那个……\r\n没事，我只是说说而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef319b1f457c06b4fe1f18b672b9fa2d3d8d2fa61fca953a274cf727ce50e80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5fe8a9bb727a32fcbad6ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热巧克力在古马雅、阿兹特克文明中\r\n也被视为能带来力量的饮料……\r\n所以……不、不嫌弃的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c8633203ff941490eb416cc4f48e7957fdd05c9306669d87da4a41ff10883c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34639c42f982c7a198531564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我是牛郎，就算是阴天也会\r\n坚持见织女一面。毕竟身为英雄\r\n可不能让公主伤心啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc79c3af83e33831c682620f0cb9b096e8a9d0e75f7bcc54f6d6b260c526ccb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d34404b5fdac608bea1a22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋……\r\n这种做法会让我很过意不去，\r\n可以……用念书给你听来代替吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ac4d2085c8de2a3052aa20739b78c088bc996fb001cbbcc2eaa84f4b452200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399d84acd49344856e9b026e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "某位男士的善举，最终催生了\r\n所谓的圣诞老人……\r\n这个故事真是太美好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6ccd16f02da78a7b88b4169abd70b33117fe678abcc6a26096a587b07e219ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05dcd76d44c3dc25edcbe2cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……不嫌弃的话请收下这份\r\n礼物……这是槲寄生胸针，据说能\r\n为配戴者带来幸福健康的生活……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73f4dbecd9afc1726bb30f22066003bce037dbeb58e02155990a16291d0032b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ddf8d2a371998749ede7c88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是大家的功劳……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6222d050993c39a888e5e7efdcea3ec1a529ec12382edae06a03d4d92ae806c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8617098cbfd942cc80a65d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个国家的除夕夜习俗都不同，\r\n听说有些国家会用钟声驱除烦恼，\r\n也有些国家会向钟声许愿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd4337fbbbb980811a89294da3576b32bba641d7d2cd59a2434f55d67488d729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15314425a7c9c7b18927f01b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐……！那个、\r\n我有一本最适合今天的诗集……\r\n不嫌弃的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1513e0b7db3a4b892e7781168118fa07428066f4c4cf6a0248209145088b5616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe720c6f2b56e44734eea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「我亲爱的读者，请让我为你\r\n特别的日子献上深深的祝福。」\r\n……如、如何！会不会太夸张……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be23898a054a4141fb02ad463a722837dc74153bd92a0d15c3d671d299f3fc53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56a70681d63a8397e79b83b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福……！真希望……\r\n这一天能够成为未来人们口中的\r\n荒漠英雄传说起始之日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2961d85eabc0e7099b244d72c7275e8b022ab71b9691e83fb887f3c1a810b47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:718687fa846b312bf959e130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说有款以「罗布・罗伊」为意象\r\n调制的酒……等、等我成年后\r\n你愿意陪我一起喝喝看吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "437ba6634c30a6b096557bcdcfbd7b503bb25ced780bec9c21259b62cc480a9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98484174eede455c89aa81a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新消息了。\r\n不知道这次里头写了什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35642f1074024d87e1df4591a8a02bd6e5f6992784374ca3dc3a803f0f1cc99c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e32ec32c96ece300ce81e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了。\r\n说不定是一份宣告传说即将展开的\r\n美好礼物喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b4807d5ffc4d35b3aee13481c2c473be90bf13b8701b519a4bf2da10a431f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2b15579648295ff47047b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了。\r\n克服难关、逐渐成长……\r\n接下来也唯有继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b130383532f34fab7984da3fa0da48d0f9a30812c38af0564ace6f1701c7e3cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24cacdbff3e5d2c8cfaeaa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动即将开始了。\r\n这次将谱写出什么故事，\r\n又会诞生怎么样的英雄呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "577008cf1d1c617f4c4d4f10ff0f0dafdef6a120f02c21b25f2e436a5b6676b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f707b534efd1b03e523103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去看看有什么活动？\r\n我有种预感……总觉得能遇上\r\n令人心头雀跃的插曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a00cebda42c26d824e11381e7eeaa911b7aac69a45cadab16c46c312934b9af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d4584d6da69e771080dec44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我力有未逮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329096a33be3f18d79936c9f392b440748ed3fa9e395600ed37fc2a6a712b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c56876832f46f5e1239316",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级提升了。\r\n训练员也正一点一滴地谱写着\r\n属于自己的英雄传说呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a232e1da35cbc4decbada83aeae651c536d62aac0edb362b994d70201920f4c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ec1b11de554d51e34d75c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このかばんですか？読みかけの\r\n文庫本も入って便利ですし、あと…\r\nか、可愛いから…お気に入りです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6365f6b1c25edc39822b4ae8bf57ae0ef581b971c5f5e169399774219147f21c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c5165069d92c1cc4311cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服…トレーナーさんから見て\r\n変じゃないですか？\r\nその、ファッションには疎くて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5a2823839032bbba57e189efe5bbcca9eeb01dc889b90bcd81f46a2eaec997e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88061e392bce462a480f7ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休日はスイープさんやカフェさんと\r\n図書館で過ごすこともあるんですが\r\n感想を言い合ったり、楽しいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750fbc9ec3b5fc8c0ecdcd18d62b946c888f909494290488293432476f362bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb9edda724c8d99e82b974b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场战斗真是势均力敌呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ced0c9564cc50e536613914a5632590c7fef57129b11d04d1022f264667344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e1c0a322053ab9fd153af2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利属于我方阵营！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4caaf99ec93867c7028c0080b366928aee829e95a78a45163be845653305ea17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424be7b1a0cca5ff05ef01ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我力有未逮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329096a33be3f18d79936c9f392b440748ed3fa9e395600ed37fc2a6a712b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4fdd1f93acf541fbf15e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场战斗真是势均力敌呢。",
