      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb850a2eec6d584b318e45e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要安排怎么样的训练呢？\r\n我会依照训练内容\r\n准备合适的书。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec58bf0c22cb9d0ed6a50c4c7da0e9ab7f824823b21ef3493407f44c7a8673e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0daae49aa9d08a0629ecd57d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想知道有关学园的英雄传说吗？\r\n每个故事都很引人入胜喔！",
